    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE20.35",
      "summary": "CRE20.35 says the primary assets are 'listed in this paragraph', but the list sits in CRE20.34.",
      "impact": "Position: Cover pool of 110 against bonds of 100 including substitution cash 8 Reading a: Reading by reference to CRE20.34: substitution cash is additional collateral, not a primary asset Reading b: Literal 'this paragraph' has no list: substitution assets cannot be classified as additional or primary Difference: Classification of 8 of the pool (primary vs additional) unresolved",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
